an %d days":[""],"%s \u00b7 runs when the system cron triggers WP-Cron":[""],"%1$s \u00b7 next run %2$s":[""],"Backup folder":[""],"Backed-up originals":[""],"files":[""],"one per optimized image":[""],"Cleanup":[""],"Daily":[""],"Never":[""],"Media Library":[""],"Hover an optimized image and click \"Restore original\" \u2014 the original comes back and thumbnails are regenerated. A side-by-side Compare view is on the image's edit screen.":[""],"WP-CLI":[""],"wp lw-img restore 123 456 \u2014 restore any number of attachments from the command line.":[""],"Kept on uninstall":[""],"Backups are never deleted when the plugin is removed \u2014 your originals stay safe in the uploads folder.":[""],"How to restore":[""],"7 days":[""],"30 days":[""],"90 days":[""],"1 year":[""],"WebP \u2014 widest support. If the converted file would not be smaller than the original, the original is kept.":[""],"AVIF \u2014 smaller files, modern browsers. If the converted file would not be smaller than the original, the original is kept.":[""],"Lossless":[""],"Lossless \u2014 pixel-perfect, larger files.":[""],"Normal":["Norm\u00e1l"],"Normal \u2014 balanced quality and size.":[""],"Aggressive":[""],"Aggressive \u2014 smaller files, slight compression may show.":[""],"Ultra":[""],"Ultra \u2014 maximum compression, visible on detailed images.":[""],"Gentle":[""],"Gentle \u2014 lightest server load":[""],"Fast":[""],"Fast \u2014 highest server load":[""],"Skip entirely (never sent to the API)":[""],"Keep original dimensions":[""],"Use optimization level\u2026":[""],"Keep EXIF metadata":[""],"General tab":[""],"see the fix on the Tester tab":[""],"Cancel the run? Images converted so far stay converted; the rest waits for the next run.":[""],"Cancel run":[""],"Optimize all in background":[""],"Put all %s failed images back in the queue? They are processed by the next run.":[""],"Retry all":[""],"Retry %s failed":[""],"Put all %s skipped images back in the queue? The next run checks them again against the current settings.":[""],"Re-scan all":[""],"Re-scan %s skipped":[""],"Checking API key and redirects, counting images\u2026":[""],"Processing speed":[""],"Pending":[""],"All-time totals, independent of the current run.":[""],"Show these images in the Media Library":[""],"Skip reasons":[""],"%1$s \u00b7 %2$s":[""],"Run finished \u2014 %1$s images optimized in %2$s, %3$s saved (\u2212%4$s%%).":[""],"See the %s skipped images in the Media Library":[""],"Run cancelled \u2014 %1$s of %2$s images processed. Converted images stay converted; press Start to continue with the rest.":[""],"Check the key on the General tab":[""],"Manage your plan in the HelloImg dashboard":[""],"The run was stopped.":[""],"Recent activity":[""],"Waiting for the first background tick\u2026 WP-Cron starts within a minute on most hosts.":[""],"Ready":[""],"Running":[""],"Finished":[""],"Cancelled":[""],"Stopped":[""],"%1$s \/ %2$s processed":[""],"Bulk run progress":[""],"Elapsed":[""],"Speed":["Sebess\u00e9g"],"Est. remaining":[""],"~%s":[""],"Saved so far":[""],"The background worker has not reported for a while. While this page is open it keeps the run moving; WP-CLI (wp lw-img optimize --all) is the reliable path on sites without traffic.":[""],"Now processing":[""],"fit inside %1$s \u00d7 %2$s px":[""],"original dimensions kept":[""],"This run uses your Upload settings":[""],"Level":["Szint"],"Output":[""],"Resize":[""],"Pattern rules":[""],"%s rule":[""],"EXIF":[""],"kept":[""],"removed":[""],"on":[""],"off":[""],"Thumbnails are regenerated from the converted file after every conversion \u2014 no separate regeneration needed.":[""],"Change on the Upload tab":[""],"%1$s images\/month \u00b7 manage your plan at %2$s":[""],"no monthly limit \u00b7 manage your plan at %s":[""],"%s saved via the API":[""],"%1$s from %2$s":[""],"Plan":[""],"This month":[""],"Optimized on this site":[""],"%s saved":[""],"API key":[""],"No key saved yet.":[""],"The saved key will be removed when you save."