o no new events are recorded. Turn on \"Logging enabled\" above and save.":[""],"Time":["Id\u0151"],"Event":[""],"File":[""],"Details":[""],"Event log":[""],"Search":["Keres\u00e9s"],"Filter":[""],"Clear":[""],"Clear all filters":[""],"No entries match these filters.":[""],"Nothing here yet.":[""],"Previous page":[""],"Next page":[""],"Rows per page":[""],"Select all rows on this page":[""],"Clear selection":[""],"Bulk actions":[""],"%d entry":[""],"%d result":[""],"Page %1$d of %2$d":[""],"Select: %s":[""],"%d selected":[""],"%1$d selected, %2$d on this page":[""],"applies to %1$d of %2$d":[""],"Filter by filename\u2026":[""],"No matching events":[""],"No events yet. Upload an image or run a bulk optimization \u2014 every conversion, skip, and failure lands here with its reason.":[""],"Scanned %s \u2014 never runs on its own.":[""],"Not scanned yet.":[""],"Scan again":[""],"Leftovers from other optimizers":[""],"No leftovers found":[""],"Checked %s \u2014 nothing of theirs is taking up space.":[""],"at least %s":[""],"of originals from optimizers you no longer use \u2014 <b>safe to delete<\/b> once you are sure you will not restore them.":[""],"beside each image":[""],"backup folder":[""],"%s files":[""],"The scan stopped early on this very large uploads folder, so the real total is higher than shown.":[""],"LW Image never touches these files: it only measures them. To reclaim the space, delete the folder or the files with your file manager, over SFTP, or from that plugin's own settings if it is still installed.":[""],"OK":[""],"Warning":["Figyelem"],"Critical":["Kritikus"],"Info":["Inform\u00e1ci\u00f3"],"%d issue":[""],"%d warning":[""],"Copied":[""],"Copy":[""],"Needs attention":[""],"%1$s, %2$s":[""],"%d critical issue":[""],"%d warning found":[""],"All checks passed \u2014 ready for bulk optimization":[""],"%d critical":[""],"%d OK":[""],"%d info":[""],"Pattern":[""],"Remove rule":[""],"Add rule":[""],"At most %d rules.":[""],"Examples:":[""],"* matches anything. A pattern without \/ matches the file name; with \/ it matches anywhere in the path. Every matching rule applies to uploads and bulk runs alike (\"Skip entirely\" also keeps the file out of smart crop). \"Skip entirely\" wins over the others; if two level rules match, the first one listed wins.":[""],"Smart crop":[""],"Smart crop runs only on converted uploads \u2014 turn on Auto-convert uploads to use it. The command line (wp lw-img smartcrop) works either way.":[""],"Smart-crop thumbnails":[""],"Re-crop the selected thumbnail sizes around the subject instead of the centre. Each selected size costs one extra API call per upload. Runs in the background right after the upload; on system-cron sites the cropped thumbnails appear within the cron interval.":[""],"Thumbnail sizes":[""],"No hard-cropped thumbnail sizes are registered on this site \u2014 smart crop has nothing to work on. Sizes that scale (keep the aspect ratio) never need it.":[""],"%1$s %2$s \u00d7 %3$s":[""],"%s (not registered on this site)":[""],"Select all":[""],"Select none":[""],"Cost per upload: 1 + %1$s = %2$s API calls.":[""],"Account":["Fi\u00f3k"],"Current defaults":[""],"Advanced":["Halad\u00f3"],"Request timeout (s)":[""],"How long to wait for the API per image. Slow jobs past the API's own 30 s window are polled automatically before giving up.":[""],"seconds":[""],"Updated %s, refreshes hourly on its own.":[""],"Refresh figures":[""],"What optimization has saved on this site so far.":[""],"No optimized images yet":[""],"Stats appear here after the first conversion. New uploads convert automatically \u2014 for everything already in the Media Library, run a bulk optimization.":[""],"Open the Bulk tab":[""],"saved":[""],"After:":[""],"Before:":[""],"Optimized images":[""],"%s%% of the Media Library":[""],"optimize the rest":[""],"Average saving":[""],"image":[""],"across all optimized images":[""],"%1$s files \u00b7 %2$s":[""],"%d-day retention":[""],"kept forever":[""],"Biggest wins":[""],"to":[""],"What happens to every new image upload.":[""],"Auto-convert uploads":[""],"Off \u2014 uploads are left untouched":[""],"Convert":[""],"Back up original":[""],"Thumbnails":[""],"New uploads are left untouched. The settings below still apply to bulk runs and to \"Optimize now\" in the Media Library, and old-URL redirects keep working.":[""],"Conversion":[""],"Output format":[""],"Optimization level":[""],"Camera info, GPS, copyright. Off by default \u2014 smaller files and removes potentially sensitive data.":[""],"Size limits":[""],"Resize large images":[""],"Images are scaled down proportionally to fit; small images are never upscaled. 0 = no limit.":[""],"Maximum width in pixels":[""],"Maximum height in pixels":[""],"px":[""],"File size range":[""],"Files outside the range are skipped (original kept). Tiny files rarely benefit; the API rejects images over 10 MB.":[""],"Minimum file size in kilobytes":[""],"KB min":[""],"Maximum file size in megabytes":[""],"MB max":[""],"Skip & exclude":[""],"Skip already-WebP \/ AVIF uploads":[""],"Recommended \u2014 no API call, no credit usage.":[""],"Skip animated GIFs":[""],"Off by default: animated GIFs become animated WebP with frames and timing preserved. If the WebP would be larger, the original is kept automatically.":[""],"After conversion":[""],"Redirect old image URLs to the converted file":[""],"Recommended. Nothing is stored: when a request for photo.jpg 404s, the plugin matches the path to its converted attachment and answers with a 301 to photo.webp \u2014 external links, sent newsletters and search results keep working. The Tester tab checks that the server lets these requests through.":[""],"Bulk optimize":[""],"Runs in the background \u2014 you can close this tab. References to converted files in post content and page-builder data are rewritten automatically.":[""],"The last status update failed; retrying in a few seconds.":[""],"WP-Cron only runs while the site receives traffic. For very large libraries the command line is the guaranteed path:":[""],"Keep backups for":[""],"Backups older than this are deleted by a daily cleanup task. Forever keeps everything \u2014 watch the folder size on large sites.":[""],"or":[""],"Backup retention in days":[""],"days":[""],"On uninstall":[""],"Delete all LW Image data when the plugin is deleted":[""],"Off (default): settings, API key, pattern rules, event log and per-image statistics survive a delete and reinstall. On: they are removed on uninstall. Backup originals are kept either way. The Deactivate link on the Plugins screen asks the same question.":[""],"Running environment checks\u2026":[""],"Environment checks \u2014 hosting problems surface here before a bulk run trips over them.":[""],"Run tests again":[""],"last run %s \u00b7 cached for 10 minutes":[""],"All checks":[""],"The last 200 events \u2014 uploads, bulk runs, Media Library actions and restores: what converted, what was skipped, and why.":[""],"Logging enabled":[""],"existing entries remain until cleared":[""]}}}